# 统一以 LF 存储文本（消除 Windows CRLF 警告），Windows 脚本保留 CRLF
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.sh  text eol=lf
# 二进制
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.jar binary

